<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>赛道十三 · 智慧教育</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 92, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>走一遍真实使用：从上传讲义到期末复习</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>下面这张不是画的，是系统真实界面截的图</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 194, width: 660 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 660, height: 297, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, overflow: 'hidden' }}>
      <Image src="assets/ui-knowledge.png" style={{ width: 658, height: 295, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 10 }}>
      知识库页：左边是学科目录（7 个库），中间是资料列表（PDF 与 Word 混放），右边可以直接就着这些资料提问
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 772, top: 190, width: 432, height: 378, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>四步走完一遍</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 10 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 86, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>一、把讲义丢进去</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          支持 PDF / Word / PPT / Excel，拍照的板书也能转成文字。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 86, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>二、就着自己的资料问</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          回答下面标着出自哪份资料、第几页，能点开看原文。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 86, borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>三、错题记下来</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          顺手标个错因，之后能按错因出新题，不是随便出一道。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 86, borderLeft: '3px solid #3D7BD9', paddingLeft: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>四、到期它会提醒</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6 }}>
          「今天练什么」只看该练的；学得怎么样，周报里有一页。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 584, width: 1128, height: 50, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
      关键一点：出处能落到「第 N 页」——这才叫有据可查，不然只是「看着像」
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>08 / 10</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
